+4. INDEPENDENT HIGH-PRECISION CROSS-CHECKS
+A third program evaluates the Gaussian expectations by closed truncated-lognormal moments
+rather than the production or second interval quadrature. If L ∼N(µ,s2), define
+Mq(a,b) = eqµ+q2s2/2
