+inputs and their original timing scope preserved.
+The response document maps every R13 finding, the inherited R12 issues, and the current
+evidence paths. It explicitly distinguishes completed calculations from unachieved neural ac-
+curacy, absent matched-accuracy classical comparisons, and remote publication status. This
+preserves the research objective without certifying a claim that the current computation has not
+established.
+
+NEURAL BELLMAN OPERATORS: SUPPLEMENT
+11
