+\end{table}
+
+The coefficient-transport calculation uses the same stored snapshot and cover, with
+\[
+ r\in[.019,.021],\quad\mu\in[.058,.062],\quad
+ \sigma_u\in[.049,.051],\quad\sigma_x\in[.195,.205],
+\]
